##### Level 0 ######

POST http://localhost:8080/addBook HTTP/1.1
Content-type: application/xml
Accept: application/xml 
# or text/xml

<book>
    <title>Blabla</title>
    <publisher>LAGUNA</publisher>
    <publishingYear>2015</publishingYear>
    <edition>SECOND</edition>
    <price>700</price>
    <discount>0</discount>
    <description> An epic tale of justice, redemption, love, and revolutionin 19th-century France, centered on the ex-convict Jean Valjean.</description>
    <genresIds>
        <values>4</values>
        <values>7</values>
        <values>8</values>
    </genresIds>
    <authorsIds>
        <values>5</values>
    </authorsIds>
</book>

### Fetch a book
POST http://localhost:8080/getBook/3de6f97b-1740-4695-9723-50e0a4b6a702 HTTP/1.1
Content-type: application/xml 
Accept: application/xml 
# or text/xml

##### Level 1 ######

### Create a book
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/level-one/books HTTP/1.1
Content-type: application/json
Accept: application/json 

{
  "title": "Blabla",
  "publisher": "LAGUNA",
  "publishingYear": 2015,
  "edition": "SECOND",
  "price": 800,
  "discount": 10,
  "description": "An epic tale of justice, redemption, love, and revolutionin 19th-century France, centered on the ex-convict Jean Valjean.",
  "genresIds": [4, 7, 8],
  "authorsIds": [5]
}

### Fetch a book
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/level-one/books/7264ccf7-c1ed-4567-b872-ba6ea8c3fdaa HTTP/1.1
Content-type: application/json
Accept: application/json 


##### Level 2 ######

### Create a book
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/level-two/books HTTP/1.1
Content-type: application/json
Accept: application/json 

{
  "title": "Some book",
  "publisher": "LAGUNA",
  "publishingYear": 2017,
  "edition": "SECOND",
  "price": 900,
  "discount": 10,
  "description": "An epic tale of justice, redemption, love, and revolutionin 19th-century France, centered on the ex-convict Jean Valjean.",
  "genresIds": [4, 7, 8],
  "authorsIds": [5]
}

### Fetch a book
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/level-two/books/57580be0-2dae-4471-8ae3-594aafa9086c HTTP/1.1
Content-type: application/json
Accept: application/json 


##### Level 3 ######

### List authors
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/level-three/authors?page=0&sort=fullName HTTP/1.1

### Get an author
http://localhost:8080/api/v1/level-three/authors/8
Accept: application/json 



### Get all books of a particular author
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/level-three/authors/8/books
Accept: application/json


### V2 endpoints ###
###  List all books
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v2/books HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json


### Get a book
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v2/books/44cc79e7-4feb-4da2-9812-970a97b0f7d3 HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json


